WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.020
Two sisters grow up in the same home, with
the same prayers and the same festivals

2
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.330
every year.

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.590
Years later, one still prays every day.

4
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.370
The other has stopped.

5
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.440
One well-known scientist argues that
children are far too young to be given a

6
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:16.970
religion at all.

7
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.480
So why do some people
come to believe in God,

8
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:23.220
while others, raised
the same way, doubt it?

9
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:26.940
In this mission, you'll see
how upbringing can shape faith,

10
00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.030
and why some critics
call it indoctrination.

11
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.220
Then you'll learn the words
for where people stand on God,

12
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.180
and ask what moves them.

13
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:40.340
Your mission: explain why people raised
the same way can end up in different places

14
00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.250
on belief.
